摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DSH Web plugin that keeps long answers and detailed prompts side by side with a dockable Composer.","id":"gh:1339001827","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-composer-layout","slug":"lavapapa/dsh-composer-layout","topics":["composer-layout","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","ui-enhancement"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DSH Web plugin that keeps long answers and detailed prompts side by side with a dockable Composer."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Composer Layout"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Switch the controls layout.\nA dockable Composer for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文\nFeatures · Install · Usage · Changelog"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Long answers and detailed prompts deserve their own space. Dock Composer to the right to reference a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"n answer while shaping your next message; keep it at the bottom for compact conversations, or let Au"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"tomatic choose as the window changes. Models, permissions, sessions, tools, and token accounting con"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"tinue to use DSH's native behavior."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Three small layout changes make the reading-and-writing workflow easier to manage:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"↔ Side-by-side drafting"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Give the answer and draft separate vertical space. Drag the divider to set their balance; scroll a l"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ong draft independently.\n▥ Adaptive layout"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Choose Bottom, Right, or Automatic. Narrow windows temporarily stack the panes; your Right preferenc"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"e returns when they fit again.\n… Space-aware controls"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"In Bottom and Right layouts, overflowing third-party input controls fold into a … popup, keeping the"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ir actions within reach."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**More everyday details:**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Per-session memory.** With “Remember this session layout” enabled, each session keeps its placem"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ent and manually resized right-pane width in this browser.\n- **Native editing.** The right-side edit"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"or fills the available input surface, including the blank area below a short draft, and retains nati"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ve text selection.\n- **Reachable pickers.** Slash and file-reference candidates stay inside the side"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" pane. Opening another Composer popup closes those candidates first.\n- **Your preferred width.** Cho"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ose a narrow, medium, or wide default right pane; fine-tune it with the divider."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"See the changelog for version differences. Entries marked **Unpublished** describe development previ"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"the changelog for version differences. Entries marked **Unpublished** describe development previews."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Use your intended Web profile in place of `web`. The npm package includes the prebuilt plugin bundle"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"se your intended Web profile in place of `web`. The npm package includes the prebuilt plugin bundle."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Follow the plugin manager's loading instructions. If it reports that a restart is needed, restart th"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"e target Web service using its usual launch method and refresh the page. Then open **Settings → Buil"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"t-in plugins → Composer Layout** and choose **Right** or **Automatic**. If you launch DSH manually:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Check the published version with `npm view dsh-composer-layout version`. Confirm the bundle is in th"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"e intended profile with `dsh --profile web --dump-config`. For dependency declarations, see `package"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ded profile with `dsh --profile web --dump-config`. For dependency declarations, see `package.json`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Install directly from GitHub"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Install directly from GitHub"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Choose a published release tag that matches your DSH version; supported ranges are declared in `peer"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"Dependencies` in `package.json`. Replace `<release-tag>` below with that tag:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The repository includes the host and browser artifacts needed for GitHub installs. Follow the plugin"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" manager's loading instructions; if a restart is needed, use the target service's usual launch metho"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"d and refresh its page."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Update an existing installation"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Stop the Web service using that profile with its usual service controls, then check the npm version "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"and replace the plugin in the same profile:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Start the target Web service again with its usual launch method and refresh the page."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Use it in DSH"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Set your default in **Settings → Built-in plugins → Composer Layout**, or use the rail at the conver"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"sation's right edge to switch between Bottom and Right. In Right layout, drag the divider to resize "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"e to switch between Bottom and Right. In Right layout, drag the divider to resize the Composer pane."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Mode | When to use it | Behavior |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| **Bottom** | Short messages or a narrow window | DSH's compact bottom editor. |\n| **Right** | Read"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" a long answer while drafting a detailed prompt | Two columns when they fit; temporary Bottom layout"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" when space runs out. |\n| **Automatic** | Change window size often | Uses the conversation main area"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"'s width-to-height ratio and the minimum width needed by both columns. |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The Automatic threshold is editable in the plugin settings. Enable session memory to keep each conve"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"rsation's layout and width. The Home/new-session screen retains DSH's native layout."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Transcript width in Right layout"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Chat uses the available left-column width; the plugin divider adjusts its reading space. DSH's two n"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ative transcript-width handles are hidden in Right layout. Returning to Bottom restores those handle"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"s and preserves DSH's saved width preference."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The changelog separates published work from development previews. Its scroll/overflow entries cover "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"native reading-position restoration, extra-control folding in Bottom, native menu surfaces and posit"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ioning, original control sizing, and unclipped inline tooltips. Check the corresponding release entr"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"y before expecting those refinements in an npm installation."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The plugin owns its implementation under `src/` and commits the generated `lib/` artifacts used by G"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"itHub installs. Before publishing:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"For contributions, see CONTRIBUTING.md."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Community"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Find the plugin in Awesome DSH Plugin, Awesome DeepSeek Harness Plugins, Awesome DSH Plugins, and Oh"},{"id":"p43s2","text":" plugin in Awesome DSH Plugin, Awesome DeepSeek Harness Plugins, Awesome DSH Plugins, and Oh My DSH."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Report a bug or suggest a feature · DSH plugin topic · DSH Market"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"More room for the next thought.\